{"7660748a-05ff-478f-a16b-afdff0e8cb18":{"id":"7660748a-05ff-478f-a16b-afdff0e8cb18","title":"Parrot Blade","altTitle":"Parrot Punisher","description":"\"Those with blood on their blades don't cross the Lower Yangtze.\"\n\nNo So-ha, the sole heir to the reputedly invincible Nine Flow Swordsmanship, lives a low-profile life with three sources of income: fishing, ferrying customers across the Lower Yangtze, and as a contract hitman for victims of injustice. Despite trying to stay away from the conflicts among martial arts factions, he finds himself taking up the most dangerous job of all: escorting to safety in Korea a girl who holds the missing part of the Sun Gun Gyung, a 1,500-year-old medical treatise written for Emperor Qin Shi Huang that is the key to achieving immortality.\n\nA Korean xianxia webtoon about a blade-for-hire's adventure in Yuan China.","year":2020,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Historical","Action","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/7660748a-05ff-478f-a16b-afdff0e8cb18/c6d53bfc-d3e3-4109-a7be-bafda6e82a27.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["ru","en","es-la"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":8.4,"follows":967,"listAt":"2026-10-27T05:13:25.529Z","chapters":[{"id":"3ddd5d8f-5a4f-4661-b464-8146e90ad264","number":"33","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":15,"createdAt":"2026-09-20T22:10:11+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"7a246748-b149-476a-9bc4-a400c843e7f6","number":"32","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":12,"createdAt":"2026-09-07T02:17:01+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"f4ac00b1-f4f9-42fd-880a-01c2442e8cb3","number":"31","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":14,"createdAt":"2026-08-13T02:18:46+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"35ccb28a-af52-4b3f-a051-faa82d6eb893","number":"30","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":14,"createdAt":"2026-05-05T02:29:22+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"580c10bf-a8b7-4dda-9dea-4c7dcd61c610","number":"29","volume":null,